          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "size": "Large",
            "weight": "Bolder",
            "text": "The first state answers on the NFA: Mississippi’s attorney general says federal suppressor registration is now voluntary for Mississippians.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "text": "She also flagged a second state law, on carrying a suppressor concealed, that is still on the books. Meanwhile DOJ told the Texas court its injunction doesn’t cover everyone in the 15 plaintiff states, so for most buyers ATF policy is the floor.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
